column39:
Random number generator problem is solved in Chrome:<p><pre><code>    var x = new Uint8Array(10); 
    window.crypto.getRandomValues(x);
    console.log(x);
</code></pre>
It's also supposed to work in FF, but for some reason doesn't:<p><a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/DOM/window.crypto" rel="nofollow">https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/DOM/window.crypto</a>

